  PoseIntent: ART ONLY. Mission lady begins sideways. Future interaction can rotate
    FacingPivot toward the player for completion/new-mission selection, then transition
    recipe-held to extended-arm offering pose. RecipeGripAnchor follows the wrist.
    No Animator, animation clip, trigger, reward/learning transaction or live scene
    replacement is implemented. Ferryman is static. Parchment is a display prop,
    never a recipe inventory stack.
